PrepFlow
Development Roadmap & Execution Plan

Version: v1.0

Status: Draft

Author: Tejas Nere

1. Purpose

This document defines the complete development roadmap for PrepFlow.

The objective is to build the platform in small, manageable milestones while ensuring code quality, scalability, and maintainability.

The roadmap follows an MVP-first approach.

2. Development Philosophy

PrepFlow will not be built feature-first.

PrepFlow will be built foundation-first.

Every feature must be supported by a scalable architecture.

The goal is to build once and expand for years.

3. Development Strategy

The project will be developed in phases.

Each phase has a clear objective and completion criteria.

No new phase should begin until the previous phase is stable.

